         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Ser o no ser\n\nSolemos reducir situaciones a dos escenarios: correcto e incorrecto, izquierda y derecha, anverso y reverso, entre otros.\n\nPara reforzar estas divisiones, decimos: si no es igual a un lado, entonces solo puede ser el otro.\n\nPero esta simplificación excesiva puede ocultar muchas cosas.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "2af7e230-a9c8-4c4b-bc6a-cd6e841f6952",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "2af7e230-a9c8-4c4b-bc6a-cd6e841f6952",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "bb226b7f-2358-437f-b6e1-668943c682d7",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=cbf361bb-a62f-4399-9776-845a7627b195",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "Si dos objetos son completamente iguales, ¿pueden tener un color diferente?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "8d1841fc-c7b2-420f-83ff-4abed282de33",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "no",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "8d1841fc-c7b2-420f-83ff-4abed282de33",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "shocking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
